  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "事件分两套，别混",
      "items": [
        "AgentSessionEvent（subscribe 能收）：agent_start/end、turn_start/end、message_*、tool_execution_*、agent_settled、queue_update、compaction_start/end、entry_appended、session_info_changed",
        "扩展的 pi.on() 事件是更大的集合（37 个）：多出 before_agent_start、tool_call/tool_result、context*、provider_*、input 等 hook"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "落盘时机",
      "items": [
        "message_end 之后才 append：assistant / user / system / toolResult → SessionMessageEntry；role=custom → CustomMessageEntry",
        "compactionSummary / branchSummary 不走 message_end，由各自流程单独写"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "排障顺序",
      "items": [
        "事件没到订阅者：先看 agent-loop 有没有发（agent-loop.js 的 emit 点），再看 AgentSession._handleAgentEvent 是否过滤",
        "扩展没收到：先确认 bindExtensions 调过（session_start 依赖它），再确认 handler 注册在 emit 之前"
      ]
    }
  ]
